- [Nicholette] Yeah, yeah.

00:04:15.497 --> 00:04:18.240
- And you never see them mass-produced,

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:19.073
- Yeah.
- It's always like,

00:04:19.073 --> 00:04:20.460
kind of in this way.
- Yeah.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.293
- Swap.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:25.416
- [Kat] Alright I love tamarind balls.

00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:26.249
- Let's go.

00:04:26.249 --> 00:04:27.910
- Alright let's go.
- Coconut drops.

