00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.380
I suggest sit and just box one of these,

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.380
shell one of these one time, as a kid.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.330
But, it's really good, delicious.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.030
- Alright so we're about to
get into these drops here.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.220
Oh, okay so it does
remind me of sugar cake.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.910
Sugar cake is like a snack
in Trinidad and we have it,

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.700
